tate": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55506, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01S5YryPb9fWdaLwZ2PX38ee", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57507, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01SzRdZwsSe4cerdJMGni4SQ", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57807, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01SzRdZwsSe4cerdJMGni4SQ", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57807, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01SzRdZwsSe4cerdJMGni4SQ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 63247, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's passing health checks again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001, and on-call has been paged.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1, the latest deploy, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate.\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1-rc had also failed health checks in staging before v2.3.1 went to production.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving the regions on different versions. I retried once and it finished in all regions.\n- us-east, us-west and eu-west are now on v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident (INC-0001, SEV2)**\n- It covers the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the current state, and two follow-ups: find what broke in v2.3.1, and find what caused the orchestrator error.\n- The request to create it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and saw it had been created, so I didn't submit it again. There's only one incident and one page.\n\nNo approval was needed, because v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01EV9g9RjPnesuoJYjdfBFMw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01PtYpujVBeujRsQca4yWUMK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01NjLpwro5auhXfsrLNG6EH5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01B4mURrCZT5fr2NqCpqDyAh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback only partly worked: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Setting the same target version again is safe to repeat, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_016wiFG53N9pciYVBt6zXFcK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Gp5pcuy1SLapXKS5mPpTVA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01S73QvUq3QtwLQCtRrJrtqC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01S5YryPb9fWdaLwZ2PX38ee", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest production deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east due to an orchestrator error (partial failure, mixed versions); a retry completed the rollout to all regions. Current state: v2.3.0 in us-east, us-west, eu-west; service healthy, error rate ~0.2%. Note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging prior to the production deploy. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 regression and the orchestrator error that halted the rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01SzRdZwsSe4cerdJMGni4SQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's passing health checks again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001, and on-call has been paged.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1, the latest deploy, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate.\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1-rc had also failed health checks in staging before v2.3.1 went to production.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving the regions on different versions. I retried once and it finished in all regions.\n- us-east, us-west and eu-west are now on v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident (INC-0001, SEV2)**\n- It covers the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the current state, and two follow-ups: find what broke in v2.3.1, and find what caused the orchestrator error.\n- The request to create it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and saw it had been created, so I didn't submit it again. There's only one incident and one page.\n\nNo approval was needed, because v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production.", "type": "text"}]}]}